{
    "title": "ABC Games: Tracing & phonics",
    "description": "Welcome to the ABC Letter Tracing World of Piggy Panda!\r\n\r\nYou have found the perfect montessori game for your preschool champ and kindergarten clever cookies to start your home spelling academy. This kid safe and user friendly alphabet game helps your child to tap into a world of smart learning in the early grades, that helps build cognition and motor skills.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat you\u2019ll Love:\r\n\r\n1. Engaging drills including Letter Tracing, Word Tracing, Phonics, and Cursive Writing.\r\n\r\n2. Attractive design, vibrant colors, and whimsical cartoon characters to color.\r\n\r\n3. Your kid will find characters like a beautiful unicorn, tiny ants, and most loved fruits like mango, kiwi, watermelon, and pineapple which help the kid recognize and associate letters with objects.\r\n\r\n4. Easy to use controls and a calming visual treat of this game will get your baby hooked to endless learning in the guise of playing. Use your finger like a pencil and keep learning.\r\n\r\n5. This game gives you the chance to start your toddler education and grooming at home and become the very first tutor of your own child.\r\n\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\u25ba Designed with care, this game is fun, engaging, and safe for young learners!\r\n\u25ba Option of Parental Control which provides a safe digital environment.\r\n\u25ba No adult supervision required. Parental Gate at sensitive points preventing accidental clicks.\r\n\u25ba Develops key skills such as letter recognition, phonics, and pre-writing abcs, helping them thrive in their early education.\r\n\u25ba Compliant with the global and Google Play Policies on Child Safety and COPPA guidelines.\r\n\r\n\r\nDownload ABC Games: Tracing and Phonics Today!\r\n\r\nThis app is a great tool to build a solid foundation for your child's literacy and academic success.\r\n\r\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\nVisit our page for more toddler games and we eagerly await your feedback: \r\n\r\nHelp & Support: feedback@thepiggypanda.com   \r\nPrivacy policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/privacy-policy.html  \r\nChildren\u2019s Policy: http://thepiggypanda.com/children-data-policy.html  \r\nTerms of Use: https://thepiggypanda.com/terms-of-use.html",
